A '''city'''<ref name="Character Enc" /> was located on the [[planet]] [[Mygeeto]]. During the [[Clone Wars]], part of the [[Mygeeto Campaign]] between [[Grand Army of the Republic]]'s [[Galactic Marines]], led by [[Clone Commander]] [[Bacara]] and [[Jedi Master]] [[Ki-Adi-Mundi]], and the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]]<ref name="Mygeeto" /> was fought in the city<ref name="III">{{Film|III}}</ref> in [[19 BBY]].<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of {{Film|III}} to [[19 BBY]].</ref> On one of the cities bridges, in the midst of [[Fourth Battle of Mygeeto|battle]] Bacara and his [[Troop|troops]] received [[Order 66]] from [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]], declaring the Jedi [[Treason|traitors]] to the [[Galactic Republic|Republic]].<ref name="III" />

